 selected root requests before evaluating those roots. Importers may consume
@@ -2128,6 +2135,12 @@ capacity, while `release_excess_capacity` rebuilds for the live item count.
 
 ## Source Parsing Boundary
 
+Embedding frontends may explicitly request notebook-fragment parsing. This uses
+the same tokenizer, declaration inventory, and file node as ordinary parsing,
+but accepts expression statements alongside module imports. It produces syntax
+facts only: the frontend must lower expressions into ordinary declarations before
+compilation. Normal file parsing and checked module grammar remain unchanged.
